∩^ω^∩\n \n \n そしてそして、なんと！！！\n 同じくBRODYさんに私のソログラビアを載せていただいています！！\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ00M28YEVEVY1ZB25M2STM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ00N354P247YF511Q4B0E2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n パワースポットに連れて行っていただきました！すごい神秘的でパワーついた感じしました∩^ω^∩♪\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ00P1NAHNJWYJ7XDP5HJX2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n いつもよりちょっとセクシーな私が見れると思います！\n 私のソログラビアも是非見て下さい∩^ω^∩\n \n ばいばい☆\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHJ00Q514NR0CQVMEANT86EV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n 加藤史帆"}],"source":"archive"}}